{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事で誤字あった(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"×お手軽→○お手紙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事なとこでミスるとか詰んだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/9056178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/9056178/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SPEC見てた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n見てないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスとかして筋肉ついた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nムキムキゴリマッチョ！\n腹筋バッキバキだぜ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"接触したことないけど\n手紙もらって嬉しい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n嬉しくないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はエイプリルフールということで\n全部嘘で答えました←\nごめんなさい○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SPECとか余裕で見てました(・ω・)ｂ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"筋肉ないです←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手紙めっちゃ嬉しいです(;_;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/9056178/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n前の方の記事ででてきたことのある\n100日メールの子(ｃ)と遊んできました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に乃木どこで\nバトンやったんだけど\nあのバトン\n実は100日メールの子のなんだよね！"},{"type":"b